# Freelancer Contract Generation — Walkthrough

## Changes Made

### 1. [contractService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/services/contractService.ts) — 2 New Template Generators

Added [generateHDKV()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/services/contractService.ts#631-802) (Hợp đồng Khoán việc, 8 sections) and [generateNDA_CTV()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/services/contractService.ts#807-949) (Thỏa thuận Bảo mật, 17 articles). Content matches original PDFs exactly.

**Key additions:**
- `CONTRACT_TYPES_FULLTIME` / `CONTRACT_TYPES_FREELANCER` arrays for type-based filtering
- [generateHDKV(employee, signingDate, contractNumber, projectName)](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/services/contractService.ts#631-802) — accepts a **project name** for the V/v header
- [generateNDA_CTV(employee, signingDate)](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/services/contractService.ts#807-949) — comprehensive confidentiality agreement

### 2. [ContractGenerator.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/ContractGenerator.tsx) — Employee Type Detection

Rewrote to auto-detect employee type and show appropriate contract options:
- **Fulltime** → HĐLĐ, HĐTV, NDA (unchanged)
- **Freelancer** → HĐKV, NDA CTV (new)

Added **project name input** for HĐKV with hint "Mỗi freelancer có thể có nhiều HĐ cho từng dự án". Also added a "Thông tin thù lao" panel showing rate info for freelancers.

### 3. [EmployeeDetail.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/EmployeeDetail.tsx) — Button Filter

Changed from `employee.type === 'fulltime'` to [(employee.type === 'fulltime' || employee.type === 'freelancer')](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/services/contractService.ts#7-8) with blue gradient for freelancers.

